# InsiderLens Web — environment (copy to .env ONLY if you need a custom API host).
#
# LOCAL DEV DEFAULT: leave VITE_API_URL unset. The app is same-origin and the
# vite dev proxy forwards /api and /health to http://localhost:8000 — zero
# CORS, zero config for the standard `uvicorn :8000` + `npm run dev` setup.
#
# Set this only for a deployed API (e.g. Phase 06/07 hosting):
# VITE_API_URL=https://insiderlens-api.example.com
